exports[`llms.txt with the preview section > matches the committed snapshot 1`] = `
"# Satelink — AI Assistance & Agent Commerce

Satelink AI Assistance: AI assistance and agent commerce for people, developers, AI agents and machines. Satelink is developed and operated by Jakuraa Commercial Private Limited.

Satelink Trading AI is an intelligent algorithmic market-analysis application built on the Satelink platform: reason, validate, score (GO / WAIT / REJECT), authorize, execute, learn. AI proposes; deterministic risk and the user's signed mandate decide; the user keeps custody and withdrawals are never enabled. Currently in controlled paper-trading beta. Live trade execution is not yet enabled. Overview: https://satelink.network/trading-agent

## Canonical concepts
- machineCommerce: https://satelink.network/products/machine-commerce
- tradingIntelligence: https://satelink.network/trading-agent/product
- x402: https://satelink.network/products/x402
- rpc: https://satelink.network/products/rpc
- metering: https://satelink.network/products/metering
- api: https://satelink.network/platform/api
- pricing: https://satelink.network/pricing
- enterprise: https://satelink.network/solutions/enterprise

## Products
### Machine Commerce (https://satelink.network/products/machine-commerce)
Machine Commerce lets software agents and machines discover, evaluate, access, meter, and pay for supported digital services programmatically.
  - call: $0.00003 / call (USD)

### RPC Infrastructure (https://satelink.network/products/rpc)
Satelink RPC is a supported blockchain gateway capability providing metered JSON-RPC access on Polygon PoS (chain 137). Software agents and automated services access endpoints programmatically, paying per call via x402 on Base or prepaid Polygon vaults.
  - call: $0.00003 / call (USD)

### x402 Machine Payments (https://satelink.network/products/x402)
x402 is an HTTP-native micropayment rail supported by Satelink: unpaid requests return HTTP 402 with machine-readable payment terms, allowing autonomous software agents to pay keylessly in USDC on Base (eip155:8453) without accounts, subscriptions, or credit card checkouts.
  - rpc-bundle: $0.1 / 1000 calls (USD)

### API Metering (https://satelink.network/products/metering)
Metering is how Satelink counts and bills usage: every paid call is measured at a flat rate and drawn down from a prepaid balance, so spend is predictable and auditable per key.
  - call: $0.00003 / call (USD)

## Discovery & payment
- Discovery: https://rpc.satelink.network/.well-known/satelink.json
- Auth: API key or x402 (HTTP 402 returns machine-readable payment requirements).
- After 402: pay per the returned requirements, or buy credits, then retry.

## Docs
- Documentation: https://docs.satelink.network
- Quickstart: https://satelink.network/developers/quickstart
- API surface: https://satelink.network/developers/api
- Pricing: https://satelink.network/pricing
- Platform: https://satelink.network/platform
- Satelink AI Assistance preview: https://satelink.network/preview

## Satelink AI Assistance (preview)
Universal AI assistance and agent commerce for people, developers, agents and machines: describe an outcome; Satelink plans it, quotes it and acts only after approval, then issues a receipt.
Status: Local preview only; not yet open to the public. Everything in the preview is simulated: SIMULATED — NO MONEY MOVED. Nothing is charged; fees are PROPOSED — NOT APPROVED. This is separate from the live metered Polygon RPC and x402 rail.
Details: https://satelink.network/preview
Capability list (JSON): https://satelink.network/.well-known/satelink-capabilities.json

### Capabilities in the registry
- dev.data.extract [SIMULATED]: Extract structured data from text (API)
- food.order.place [SIMULATED]: Order food for delivery
