- shop.digital_goods.purchase [SIMULATED]: Buy a digital product
- token.risk [COMING_SOON]: Token risk signal
- token.verdict [COMING_SOON]: Token verdict
- trading.paper.order [SIMULATED]: Paper trade a GO strategy (simulation)
- trading.strategy.evaluate [SIMULATED]: Evaluate a trading strategy (simulation)
- wallet.balance [PREVIEW]: Wallet balance check
"
